\group Harmonic Functions <p></p>Every bounded harmonic function <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$u:\\R ^n\\to \\R $\">$u:\\R ^n\\to \\R $</span> is constant.  <section class=\"theorem proof\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proof</div><p>\\sketch For any <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$x_0$\">$x_0$</span> and <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$r&gt;0$\">$r&gt;0$</span>, the derivative estimate gives </p><p><span class=\"math\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\[ |Du(x_0)|\\le \\frac{C_1\\alpha (n)}r\\| u\\| _{L^\\infty (\\R ^n)}. \\]\">\\[ |Du(x_0)|\\le \\frac{C_1\\alpha (n)}r\\| u\\| _{L^\\infty (\\R ^n)}. \\]</span></p><p> Letting <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$r\\to \\infty $\">$r\\to \\infty $</span> gives <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$Du=0$\">$Du=0$</span>. </p><span class=\"qed\" aria-label=\"证毕\" style=\"display:block;text-align:right\">□</span></section>","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: group、sketch"]},"previous":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#sec:laplace-liouvilles-theorem","next":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#thm:representation-formula-bounded-solutions","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#thm:harmonic-function-derivative-estimates","title":"thm:harmonic-function-derivative-estimates","label":"thm:harmonic-function-derivative-estimates"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#thm:liouville-mvp","title":"thm:liouville-mvp","label":"thm:liouville-mvp"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#thm:representation-formula-bounded-solutions","title":"thm:representation-formula-bounded-solutions","label":"thm:representation-formula-bounded-solutions"}],"copy_context":{"version":1,"level":0,"node":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#thm:liouville-theorem-harmonic","titl